 staff member who didn’t seem to pick up on social cues that we preferred a quiet morning.\\u003cbr\\u003eLastly, this is the only hotel I’ve experienced that requires an “exit pass” after checkout while they inspect the room. It felt more like a hospital discharge process than a hotel stay.\\u003cbr\\u003eOverall, very poor maintenance standards and inconsistent service. I would not recommend staying here.\",null,\"Very disappointing stay. Definitely not worth the price.\\u003cbr\\u003eI gave Sotogrande another chance after a bad experience in Baguio, hoping it was\",false,true]]],\"\",null,[2],[[1,[1,5]],[4,[1,5]],[5,[1,5]]],\"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21jd1NXRmxaMlYzTUVsbWFpMVZjR3BLTkVSeE1sRRAB\",\"\",null,null,null,null,[[\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ANxoTn0_IUIWF0YJ9UutsLBbdV5HyDPIXYmjR4XLV59CyiKzAJUUUAd-gRf06qrJ2yvCPkPrvVfuD8BYOcCCTdsrDspKZ08jHAZr1cT5hKsYkaiWZ7LtfuLwPKTZcjMvigqSUdT6qVpbdcb02vY\\u003dk-no\",5712,4284,null,[0,null,false,false],null,null,null,null,null,[\"Roscel Isip\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXtFpCNU7O-XhfTEf-Wsw7KFKq7-cmvL0-02qchBF6Gspk7_ZIB\\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-br100\",\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104981743689922150696?hl\\u003den-US\"],null,null,3,[10,\"CIABIhA_6E19qSWvpn10VavzISjz\"],null,10,[null,[10,\"CIABIhA_6E19qSWvpn10VavzISjz\"],[10,3,[5712,4284]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[\"Sotogrande Davao Hotel\"]],[null,[[[\"Roscel Isip\"],\"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104981743689922150696?hl\\u003den-US\",\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXtFpCNU7O-XhfTEf-Wsw7KFKq7-cmvL0-02qchBF6Gspk7_ZIB\\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-br100\",null,null,\"104981743689922150696\"]]],[[[2],[[null,null,null,null,1]]]],[2,null,null,null,null,[null,null,null,[7,3]],null,null,[2026,2,19,9,null,null,null,null,[\"2 months ago\"]]],[\"//www.google.com/local/imagery/report/?cb_client\\u003dunknown_client.hotels_search\\u0026image_key\\u003d!1e10!2sCIABIhA_6E19qSWvpn10VavzISjz\\u0026fid\\u003d0x0:0x3544bafb0adf5ecd